                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On 5th September 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre celebrated Teachers' Day at its Rohini Sector-6 facility, gathering staff and students to pay tribute to the dedication and hard work of their esteemed educators. The event aimed to express gratitude for the profound impact teachers have on shaping the futures of countless students.
                                    The celebration featured speeches from students sharing their heartfelt experiences with Skillbook’s instructors, as well as performances, games, and activities to foster a spirit of appreciation and joy. Special honors were presented to faculty members, recognizing their contributions to fostering a supportive learning environment.
                                    Skillbook’s founders, Mrs. Pooja and Mr. Ashish, took the opportunity to personally thank each teacher, highlighting their commitment to empowering students with essential skills and knowledge. The celebration ended on a high note, with smiles all around and a renewed sense of community, marking a memorable Teachers' Day for everyone involved.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
